In addition to fixing several bugs in the .nethackrc Editor, I made a few
changes to some of the info pages as well:

1)	The Players Lists page (at <a
href="http://nethack.devnull.net/tournament/players.html">) now gives a list of
Clans established for the Tournament.  Looks like we have 10 competing Clans so
far (as the admin Clan is not a competitor).

2)	The Players Information Page (at <a
href="http://nethack/tournament/player_info.html">) page will now give you the
list of completed games for any player who has filled in their player
information.  These games are listed in the Tournament's cannonical sequence
(i.e., the sequence in which the control server received them), so this is also
the order used when calculating the sequence dependant Trophies.

